{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペットです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、色んな呼び方でメンバーが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"呼んでくれるの、密かに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい（ミ＾u＾ミ）くふっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、そう言ったら調子にのって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"連呼してくるだろうから言わない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらりんとか！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(せ ՞ਊ ՞)｛  ペッツ！ペッツ！  …笑。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなメンバーが大好き ***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、広島・福岡で買ったお土産を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族に贈りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喜んでくれたら、嬉しいな。○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々に電話もしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が、部活で毎日帰りが遅くて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その度に、うるさいほど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「早く帰ってきなさい」って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配してたお父さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電話に出るなり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く(実家に)帰ってきなさいって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また言われちゃった(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きくなって帰るから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう少し、待っててよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"…なんて言ったら、お父さん調子に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のってくるだろうから言わない！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/03/photo_5.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん"}],"source":"archive"}